{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142/events","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/2142","id":1607188,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNjA3MTg4","number":2142,"title":"[Bug]Inconsistent PathInfo parsing/checking","user":{"login":"Blackskyliner","id":1038517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzg1MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1038517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner","html_url":"https://github.com/Blackskyliner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blackskyliner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":100079,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAwNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null},{"id":125366,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjUzNjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/HttpFoundation","name":"HttpFoundation","color":"DDDDDD","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2011-09-09T12:37:52Z","updated_at":"2011-09-28T13:07:15Z","closed_at":"2011-09-28T13:07:15Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have found an Bug regarding some inconsistency in how Symfony2 proccesses URI's.\n\nThe problem occured for me when I used some domainstring, wich got some special characters translated into the URI notation.\n\nAll the time my routing failed I got a \"GET hp\" while trying to get on my server using \n\n```\nhttp://localhost/~blackskyliner/Symfony SVN/trunk/web/app_dev.php\n```\n\nI isolated the point when and where the bug happens.\n\nFirst I want to show, in a short snippet, what actually happens.\n\n``` php\n<?php\n$requestUri = \"/~blackskyliner/Symfony%20SVN/trunk/web/app_dev.php\";\n$baseUrl = \"/~blackskyliner/Symfony SVN/trunk/web/app_dev.php\";\n$pathInfo = \"/\";\n\n$pathInfo = substr($requestUri, strlen($baseUrl));\n\necho $pathInfo; // hp get's echoed instead of an empty string... leading to an fake GET request to a route called hp...\n```\n\nThis all happens in the \"preparePathInfo()\" function of the \"Symfony\\Component\\HttpFoundation\\Request\" class of Symfony2 - in an if statement but it happens.\n\nSo for me it seems there is some lack of consistency for checking the domainstring for routing purposes.\nBoth parameters should be encoded or decoded, so there is an consistent handling.\n","closed_by":{"login":"fabpot","id":47313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot","html_url":"https://github.com/fabpot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/2142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}